#: alarmmanager_admin.php:50
msgid "The administration action succeeded."
msgstr "Isenzo sokuphatha siphumelele."

#: alarmmanager_admin.php:86
msgid "Administration unavailable or permission denied."
msgstr "Ukuphatha akutholakali noma imvume inqatshiwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:78
msgid "Choose the alarm information to send to any service. Use Combined text to arrange device details, or Use device message to start with a complete message. Email uses Subject and Message; API destinations use the field names required by the receiving service."
msgstr "Khetha ulwazi lwe-alamu ozoluthumela kunoma iyiphi isevisi. Sebenzisa umbhalo ohlanganisiwe ukuhlela imininingwane yedivayisi, noma Sebenzisa umlayezo wedivayisi ukuqala ngomlayezo ophelele. I-imeyili isebenzisa Isihloko Nomlayezo; izindawo okuyiwa kuzo ze-API zisebenzisa amagama ezinkambu adingwa yisevisi eyamukelayo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:79
msgid "Advanced message configuration"
msgstr "Ukumiswa komlayezo okuthuthukisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:90
msgid "New endpoint"
msgstr "Indawo yokuxhumana entsha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Custom integration"
msgstr "Ukuhlanganiswa okwenziwe ngokwezifiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Integration provider"
msgstr "Umhlinzeki wokuhlanganiswa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "API Key SID and Secret (recommended)"
msgstr "I-API Key SID kanye neMfihlo (kuyanconywa)"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Account SID and Auth Token"
msgstr "I-Account SID kanye ne-Auth Token"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Twilio credentials"
msgstr "Iziqinisekiso zokungena ze-Twilio"

#: includes/admin_view.php:113
msgid "Send using"
msgstr "Thumela usebenzisa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Isigameko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Incident"
msgstr "Isigameko esibucayi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "ServiceNow record type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwerekhodi ye-ServiceNow"

#: includes/admin_view.php:126
msgid "Changing the record type replaces the destination table, message fields and recovery settings with its defaults. Your instance and credentials are retained."
msgstr "Ukushintsha uhlobo lwerekhodi kushintsha ithebula lendawo okuyiwa kuyo, izinkambu zomlayezo kanye nezilungiselelo zokululama ngokuzenzakalelayo kwalo. Isibonelo sakho neziqinisekiso zakho zokungena kuyagcinwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:149
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Indawo Ekuyiwa Kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:154
msgid "Email settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo ze-imeyili"

#: includes/admin_view.php:161
msgid "Delivery uses the Cacti mail settings. Add the people who should receive these alarms."
msgstr "Ukulethwa kusebenzisa izilungiselelo zeposi ze-Cacti. Engeza abantu okufanele bathole lawa ma-alamu."

#: includes/admin_view.php:162
msgid "Script settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo zeskripthi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "JSON output is sent to the script on standard input."
msgstr "Okuphumayo kwe-JSON kuthunyelwa kuskripthi kokokufaka okujwayelekile."

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "The executable must exist and be executable by the worker on every delivering poller. Arguments are passed directly without a shell."
msgstr "Ifayela elisebenzisekayo kufanele libe khona futhi lisebenziseke kumsebenzi ku-poller ngayinye elethayo. Izimpikiswano zidluliswa ngqo ngaphandle kwe-shell."

#: includes/admin_view.php:169
msgid "WebSocket delivery is not implemented."
msgstr "Ukulethwa kwe-WebSocket akukasetshenziswa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:171
msgid "Advanced delivery settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo zokulethwa ezithuthukisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:176
msgid "Connection options"
msgstr "Izinketho zokuxhumana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:179
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Indlela"

#: includes/admin_view.php:186
msgid "Certificate and hostname verification remain enabled. Provision the PEM file on every poller. Saved credentials are never displayed."
msgstr "Ukuqinisekiswa kwesitifiketi negama lomsingathi kuhlala kunikwe amandla. Hlinzeka ngefayela le-PEM ku-poller ngayinye. Iziqinisekiso zokungena ezilondoloziwe azikaze ziboniswe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:187
msgid "Other delivery options"
msgstr "Ezinye izinketho zokulethwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189 includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Khansela"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189
msgid "Test destination saves the current settings and queues a sample alarm for this destination. Enable the destination before testing."
msgstr "Ukuhlola indawo okuyiwa kuyo kulondoloza izilungiselelo zamanje futhi kubeka i-alamu eyisibonelo kulayini wale ndawo. Nika amandla indawo okuyiwa kuyo ngaphambi kokuhlola."

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Save endpoint"
msgstr "Londoloza indawo yokuxhumana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Test destination"
msgstr "Hlola indawo okuyiwa kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete endpoint"
msgstr "Susa indawo yokuxhumana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete this endpoint, its delivery settings and saved credentials"
msgstr "Susa le ndawo yokuxhumana, izilungiselelo zayo zokulethwa kanye neziqinisekiso zokungena ezilondoloziwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Deleting stops future delivery and removes the saved settings and credentials. Remove notification rule references and resolve queued or running deliveries first. Completed and failed delivery history is preserved."
msgstr "Ukususa kumisa ukulethwa kwesikhathi esizayo futhi kususa izilungiselelo ezilondoloziwe neziqinisekiso zokungena. Susa izireferensi zomthetho wesaziso kuqala bese uxazulula ukulethwa okukulayini noma okusebenzayo. Umlando wokulethwa oqediwe nohlulekile uyagcinwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:205
msgid "Chat and messaging"
msgstr "Ingxoxo nemilayezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:206
msgid "Post alarms to a Slack channel."
msgstr "Thumela ama-alamu esiteshini se-Slack."

#: includes/admin_view.php:207
msgid "Post alarm cards through a Teams Workflow."
msgstr "Thumela amakhadi e-alamu nge-Teams Workflow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:208
msgid "Send alarms from a Telegram bot."
msgstr "Thumela ama-alamu avela ku-bot ye-Telegram."

#: includes/admin_view.php:209
msgid "Text alarms to phone numbers."
msgstr "Thumela ama-alamu ombhalo ezinombolweni zocingo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:210
msgid "Send approved WhatsApp templates."
msgstr "Thumela izifanekiso ze-WhatsApp ezigunyaziwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:211
msgid "Incident management"
msgstr "Ukuphathwa kwezigameko ezibucayi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:212
msgid "Trigger and resolve PagerDuty incidents."
msgstr "Qala futhi uxazulule izigameko ezibucayi ze-PagerDuty."

#: includes/admin_view.php:213
msgid "Open and resolve ServiceNow incidents or events."
msgstr "Vula futhi uxazulule izigameko ezibucayi noma izigameko ze-ServiceNow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:214
msgid "Network management"
msgstr "Ukuphathwa kwenethiwekhi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:215
msgid "Send SNMPv2c or SNMPv3 traps and INFORMs."
msgstr "Thumela imigibe ye-SNMPv2c noma ye-SNMPv3 kanye nama-INFORM."

#: includes/admin_view.php:216
msgid "Forward RFC 5424 or RFC 3164 messages over UDP, TCP or TLS."
msgstr "Dlulisela phambili imilayezo ye-RFC 5424 noma RFC 3164 nge-UDP, TCP noma TLS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:217
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Okwezifiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:218
msgid "Start from an empty endpoint."
msgstr "Qala endaweni yokuxhumana engenalutho."

#: includes/admin_view.php:219
msgid "POST alarm JSON to any HTTPS endpoint."
msgstr "Thumela nge-POST i-JSON ye-alamu kunoma iyiphi indawo yokuxhumana ye-HTTPS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:220
msgid "Call an API with your own method, authentication and response checks."
msgstr "Shayela i-API ngendlela yakho, ukuqinisekiswa kanye nokuhlolwa kwezimpendulo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:221
msgid "Run a local executable with the alarm as JSON input."
msgstr "Sebenzisa ifayela elisebenzisekayo lasendaweni eline-alamu njengokufakwa kwe-JSON."

#: includes/admin_view.php:227
msgid "Add integration"
msgstr "Engeza ukuhlanganiswa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Choose a template. It opens as a disabled draft; nothing is sent until you enable it."
msgstr "Khetha isifanekiso. Sivula njengohlaka olukhutshaziwe; akukho okuthunyelwayo uze usinike amandla."

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Search integrations"
msgstr "Sesha izihlanganiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:234
msgid "Blank endpoint"
msgstr "Indawo yokuxhumana engenalutho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:239
msgid "No integrations match your search."
msgstr "Azikho izihlanganiso ezifana nokusesha kwakho."

#: includes/admin_view.php:243
msgid "SNMP trap settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo zomgibe we-SNMP"

#: includes/admin_view.php:259
msgid "Saved community and passphrases are encrypted and never displayed. Leave them blank to keep the saved values; entering any value replaces all saved SNMP secrets."
msgstr "Umphakathi olondoloziwe nemisho yokungena kubetheliwe futhi akukaze kuboniswe. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze ugcine amanani alondoloziwe; ukufaka noma yiliphi inani kuthatha indawo yazo zonke izimfihlo ze-SNMP ezilondoloziwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:260
msgid "Traps are sent as Cacti's CACTI-MIB cactiNotify with the snmptrap binary from Cacti Settings > Paths on every delivering poller. Add one destination per receiver."
msgstr "Imigibe ithunyelwa njenge-CACTI-MIB cactiNotify ye-Cacti ngefayela le-snmptrap elivela ku-Izilungiselelo ze-Cacti > Izindlela ku-poller ngayinye elethayo. Engeza indawo okuyiwa kuyo eyodwa kumamukeli ngamunye."

#: includes/admin_view.php:261
msgid "Syslog settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo ze-Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:269
msgid "TLS verifies the receiver certificate and hostname. Use port 6514 for TLS. UDP and TCP are unencrypted, and a UDP message is confirmed only as sent."
msgstr "I-TLS iqinisekisa isitifiketi somamukeli negama lomsingathi. Sebenzisa imbobo 6514 ku-TLS. I-UDP ne-TCP azibethelwe, futhi umlayezo we-UDP uqinisekiswa kuphela njengothunyelwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:278 setup.php:191
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Izinsuku"

#: includes/admin_view.php:283
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Indawo yesikhathi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:291
msgid "Times use the selected timezone and the alarm event time. An end time before the start runs overnight. Equal times cover the entire selected day."
msgstr "Izikhathi zisebenzisa indawo yesikhathi ekhethiwe nesikhathi sesigameko se-alamu. Isikhathi sokuphela esingaphambi kokuqala sisebenza ubusuku bonke. Izikhathi ezilinganayo zihlanganisa usuku lonke olukhethiwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:332 includes/admin_view.php:521
msgid "Create a rule"
msgstr "Dala umthetho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Kunikwe amandla"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "Okubaluleke kuqala"

#: includes/admin_view.php:334
msgid "Rule and destination"
msgstr "Umthetho nendawo okuyiwa kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:338
msgid "Alarm Destination"
msgstr "Indawo Ye-alamu"

#: includes/admin_view.php:341
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "ikhutshaziwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:343
msgid "Select one or more alarm destinations. Disabled destinations do not send alarms."
msgstr "Khetha indawo okuyiwa kuyo ye-alamu eyodwa noma ngaphezulu. Izindawo okuyiwa kuzo ezikhutshaziwe azithumeli ama-alamu."

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Message template"
msgstr "Isifanekiso somlayezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Use each destination default, or customize its message for this rule. Customization starts with a copy of the destination template and does not change other rules. If several rules match the same destination, the first matching rule in priority and ID order supplies its template."
msgstr "Sebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo kwendawo okuyiwa kuyo ngayinye, noma yenza umlayezo wayo ngokwezifiso kulo mthetho. Ukwenza ngokwezifiso kuqala ngekhophi yesifanekiso sendawo okuyiwa kuyo futhi akushintshi eminye imithetho. Uma imithetho eminingi ifana nendawo okuyiwa kuyo efanayo, umthetho wokuqala ofanayo ngokulandelana kokubaluleka ne-ID unikeza isifanekiso sawo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:352
msgid "Custom template"
msgstr "Isifanekiso esenziwe ngokwezifiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
msgid "Destination recipient"
msgstr "Umamukeli wendawo okuyiwa kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
#, php-format
msgid "Recipients: %d"
msgstr "Abamukeli: %d"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Customize message for this rule"
msgstr "Yenza umlayezo walo mthetho ngokwezifiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Unchecked: Use destination default."
msgstr "Akumakiwe: Sebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo kwendawo okuyiwa kuyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:361
msgid "Optional: add each phone number in international format, such as +15551234567. These numbers replace the destination recipient for this rule. Leave the list empty to use the destination default. Each number has its own delivery status and retries."
msgstr "Ngokuzithandela: engeza inombolo yocingo ngayinye ngefomethi yamazwe ngamazwe, njengo-+15551234567. Lezi zinombolo zithatha indawo yomamukeli wendawo okuyiwa kuyo kulo mthetho. Shiya uhlu lungenalutho ukuze usebenzise okuzenzakalelayo kwendawo okuyiwa kuyo. Inombolo ngayinye inesimo sayo sokulethwa nokuzama kabusha."

#: includes/admin_view.php:374
msgid "None"
msgstr "Akukho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Build device conditions using AND, OR and groups. These conditions use the current Cacti device settings and must also satisfy any alarm filters below. With no device conditions, all devices can match."
msgstr "Yakha izimo zedivayisi usebenzisa u-AND, OR kanye namaqembu. Lezi zimo zisebenzisa izilungiselelo zamanje zedivayisi ye-Cacti futhi kumele zanelise nanoma yiziphi izihlungi ze-alamu ezingezansi. Uma zingekho izimo zedivayisi, wonke amadivayisi angafana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Match devices"
msgstr "Qondanisa amadivayisi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"
msgstr "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Device Status"
msgstr "Isimo Sedivayisi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Syslog"
msgstr "Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Thold"
msgstr "Thold"

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Build alarm conditions using AND, OR, NOT and groups. Alarms must also match the device conditions above."
msgstr "Yakha izimo ze-alamu usebenzisa u-AND, OR, NOT kanye namaqembu. Ama-alamu kumele futhi afane nezimo zedivayisi ezingenhla."

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Match alarms"
msgstr "Qondanisa ama-alamu"

#: includes/admin_view.php:395
msgid "No alarm sources detected yet. Sources appear after their first alarm."
msgstr "Ayikho imithombo ye-alamu etholiwe okwamanje. Imithombo ivela ngemva kwe-alamu yayo yokuqala."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "By default, matching alarms can notify at any time. Turn on a schedule to limit when this rule matches."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, ama-alamu afanayo angazisa nganoma yisiphi isikhathi. Vula ishejuli ukuze ukhawulele ukuthi lo mthetho ufana nini."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "Notification hours"
msgstr "Amahora esaziso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppress notifications"
msgstr "Cindezela izaziso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppressed alarms remain in history. Recovery notifications bypass acknowledgment, cooldown and duplicate suppression, but still follow notification hours and maintenance windows."
msgstr "Ama-alamu acindezelwe ahlala emlandweni. Izaziso zokululama zeqa ukuvuma, isikhathi sokupholisa nokucindezelwa kwezimpinda, kodwa zisalandela amahora esaziso namawindi okulungisa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:403
msgid "Set a duration to 0 to turn it off."
msgstr "Setha ubude besikhathi bube ngu-0 ukuze uyicime."

#: includes/admin_view.php:405
msgid "Rule order"
msgstr "Ukuhleleka kwemithetho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Create rule"
msgstr "Dala umthetho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Rules with equal priority run in ID order. Stopping also applies when this rule suppresses notifications."
msgstr "Imithetho enokubaluleka okulinganayo isebenza ngokulandelana kwe-ID. Ukuma kuyasebenza futhi uma lo mthetho ucindezela izaziso."

#: includes/admin_view.php:417
msgid "Configuration Backup/Restore"
msgstr "Isipele/Ukubuyisela Ukumiswa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Kumisiwe okwesikhashana"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Iyasebenza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "everything has been delivered"
msgstr "konke sekulethiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "oldest queued %s UTC"
msgstr "endala kakhulu kulayini %s UTC"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "waiting messages"
msgstr "imilayezo elindile"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "Hide messages"
msgstr "Fihla imilayezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "View messages"
msgstr "Buka imilayezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "I-endpoint"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "ID"
msgstr "I-ID"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Umlayezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Next try"
msgstr "Umzamo olandelayo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441 includes/reports.php:458
msgid "Queued"
msgstr "Kukulayini"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Tries"
msgstr "Imizamo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:451
msgid "Times in UTC · first 100 shown"
msgstr "Izikhathi ku-UTC · ezokuqala eziyi-100 zibonisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Pause delivery"
msgstr "Misa okwesikhashana ukulethwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Resume delivery"
msgstr "Qhubeka nokulethwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Clear queue"
msgstr "Sula ulayini"

#: includes/admin_view.php:459
#, php-format
msgid "Discard all %d waiting notifications on this poller?"
msgstr "Lahla zonke izaziso ezilindile ezingu-%d kule poller?"

#: includes/admin_view.php:460
msgid "Includes retries. They stay in delivery history as failed, reason queue_cleared."
msgstr "Kufaka ukuzama kabusha. Zihlala emlandweni wokulethwa njengezihlulekile, isizathu queue_cleared."

#: includes/admin_view.php:461
msgid "Messages already sending and alarm state are kept."
msgstr "Imilayezo esivele ithunyelwa kanye nesimo se-alamu kuyagcinwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:462
msgid "Tip: pause delivery first during maintenance."
msgstr "Icebiso: misa okwesikhashana ukulethwa kuqala ngesikhathi sokulungisa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:463
msgid "Clear queue…"
msgstr "Sula ulayini…"

#: includes/admin_view.php:464
msgid "Controls apply to this poller. While paused, alarms are still received and queued; Resume sends them."
msgstr "Izilawuli zisebenza kule poller. Ngenkathi imiswe okwesikhashana, ama-alamu asatholwa futhi abekwe kulayini; uQhubeka uyawathumela."

#: includes/admin_view.php:467
msgid "View delivery results"
msgstr "Buka imiphumela yokulethwa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:470
msgid "Create an integration, configure its destination and credentials, test a sample alarm here, then select it directly in a rule."
msgstr "Dala ukuhlanganiswa, lungisa indawo okuyiwa kuyo kanye neziqinisekiso zako, hlola i-alamu eyisibonelo lapha, bese uyikhetha ngqo emthethweni."

#: includes/admin_view.php:476
msgid "Configured integrations"
msgstr "Izihlanganiso ezilungisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:479
msgid "No integrations yet. Choose a template above to create one."
msgstr "Azikho izihlanganiso okwamanje. Khetha isifanekiso ngenhla ukuze udale eyodwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Alarm Rules"
msgstr "Imithetho Ye-alamu"

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Choose which alarms should notify, where to send them and when to pause notifications. Rules run from lowest to highest priority."
msgstr "Khetha ukuthi yimaphi ama-alamu okufanele azise, azothunyelwa kuphi nokuthi zizomiswa nini okwesikhashana izaziso. Imithetho isebenza kusuka kokuphansi kakhulu kuya kokuphezulu kakhulu."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create an integration before saving your first rule."
msgstr "Dala ukuhlanganiswa ngaphambi kokulondoloza umthetho wakho wokuqala."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create integration"
msgstr "Dala ukuhlanganiswa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Sula"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "Okubucayi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Ulwazi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Major"
msgstr "Okukhulu"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Minor"
msgstr "Okuncane"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Occurrence"
msgstr "Ukwenzeka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Raised"
msgstr "Kuphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Recovered"
msgstr "Kululeme"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Reminder"
msgstr "Isikhumbuzi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Updated"
msgstr "Ibuyekeziwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Isexwayiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:520
msgid "Alarm notifications require an enabled matching Alarm Rule. Without one, alarms remain in history but no notifications are sent."
msgstr "Izaziso ze-alamu zidinga Umthetho We-alamu ofanayo onikwe amandla. Ngaphandle kwawo, ama-alamu ahlala emlandweni kodwa azikho izaziso ezithunyelwayo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:524
msgid "No rules yet. Create a rule below to start routing alarms to your notification destinations."
msgstr "Ayikho imithetho okwamanje. Dala umthetho ngezansi ukuze uqale ukuthumela ama-alamu ezindaweni zakho zezaziso okuyiwa kuzo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:533
